TIP:  This version is from their 25th Anniversary Concert.  It starts acapella with the opening note a <g>, open 3rd string.  Pick it once to get your vocal bearings.
 
TIP:  At the end you see "<trill>" which means to rapidly strum the (G), starting on the treble side and finishing on the bass side.     
  
 
